<title>USA: Genovese Drug Q3 shr rises to $0.21.</title>
<headline>Genovese Drug Q3 shr rises to $0.21.</headline>
<dateline>MELVILLE, N.Y. 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>GENOVESE DRUG STORES, INC.</p>
<p>				     Third Quarter Ended (12 Weeks)</p>
<p>				   Nov 8, 1996	     Nov 10, 1995</p>
<p> Sales			  $159,108,000	     $137,719,000</p>
<p> Net Income			2,351,000		  1,788,000</p>
<p> Net Income Per Common Share	 .21		     .16(a)</p>
<p>Average Number of Common</p>
<p>  Shares Outstanding	  11,121,000	    11,085,000(a)</p>
<p>					   Year To Date (40 Weeks)</p>
<p>				   Nov 8, 1996	     Nov 10, 1995</p>
<p> Sales			   515,723,000		454,968,000</p>
<p> Net Income			5,452,000	     4,604,000(b)</p>
<p> Net Income Per Common Share	 .49		  .42(a)(b)</p>
<p>Average Number of Common</p>
<p>  Shares Outstanding	  11,110,000	    11,084,000(a)</p>
<p>(a) Adjusted retroactively to reflect the effect of a 10 percent stock dividend distributed on January 4, 1996.</p>
<p>(b) Includes $722,000, or $.07 per common share from a gain on the sale of the nursing home division.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
